    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga Ammaana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiyow, waxaad tahay Ilaahay. Waan ku sarraysiin doonaa, oo magacaagana waan ammaani doonaa, waayo, waxaad samaysay waxyaalo yaab badan oo ah talooyin aad waa hore aaminnimo iyo run ku talo gashay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waxaad magaalo ka dhigtay meel tuulan, oo magaalo deyr lehna burbur, oo daartii weynayd ee shisheeyahana waxaad ka dhigtay wax aan magaalo ahayn, oo mar dambena lama dhisi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dadka xoogga badanu way ku ammaani doonaan, oo magaalada quruumaha laga cabsadona way ka cabsan doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waxaad miskiinka u ahayd xoog, oo saboolka baahanna markuu dhibaataysnaa xoog baad u ahayd, waxaadna ahayd meel duufaanka laga dugsado oo kulaylkana laga hadhsado markii kuwa laga cabsado neeftoodu ay ahayd sida duufaan derbi ku dhacaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad hoos u ridi doontaa buuqa shisheeyayaasha sida kulaylka meesha engegan oo kale. Sida hooska daruurtu kulaylka u rida ayaa kuwa laga cabsado gabaygooda hoos loo ridi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu dadyowga oo dhan buurtan ugu samayn doonaa diyaafad ah baruur miidhan, iyo khamri raagay, iyo waxyaalo baruur badan oo dhuux ka buuxo, iyo khamri raagay oo aad loo miiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagu wuxuu buurtan ku baabbi'in doonaa daboolka dadyowga oo dhan la dul saaray iyo indhashareerta quruumaha oo dhan lagu dul fidiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhimashadana weligeed buu liqay, Sayidka Rabbiga ahuna weji kastaba ilmada wuu ka tirtiri doonaa, oo ceebta dadkiisana dhulka oo dhan wuu ka qaadi doonaa, waayo, sidaasuu Rabbigu ku hadlay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa maalintaas la odhan doonaa, Bal eega, waa kan Ilaahayagu. Isagaannu sugaynay, wuuna na badbaadin doonaa. Kanu waa Rabbiga, isagaannu sugaynay, oo waxaannu ku farxi oo ku rayrayn doonnaa badbaadintiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga gacantiisu waxay saarnaan doontaa buurtan, oo Moo'aabna meeshiisaa lagula tuman doonaa sida cawska meesha digada lagula tunto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna gacmihiisuu ku dhex kala fidin doonaa sida mid dabaalanaya gacmihiisa u kala fidiyo inuu dabaasho aawadeed, laakiinse Rabbigu wuxuu hoos u ridi doonaa kibirkooda iyo shuqulkii gacmahoodaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qalcadda dheer oo derbiyadaada adagna wuu dumin doonaa, oo hoos buu u ridi doonaa, oo dhulka iyo ilaa ciidda, ayuu ku xoori doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
